  "summary": "I’m a Full-Stack Developer with 4 years of experience building and optimizing mission-critical software. My current position is with the FAA, with the development and optimization of a Human-In-The-Loop, Air Traffic Control (ATC) simulator.\n\nMy main technical toolbox includes JavaScript, TypeScript, Node.js, Python, C++, Godot, and Java — and I love finding the right tool for the job to bring ideas to life. Whether it’s enhancing performance behind the scenes or designing smooth, user-friendly interfaces, I’m always focused on delivering high-quality results.\n\nI'm always learning, always improving, and always excited to tackle new challenges alongside great teams.\n\nLet’s connect!",
