    "description": "Continuing project work with the Federal Aviation Administration Research, Development, and Human Factors Laboratory (RDHFL) since May 2022 as part of the same engineering team. \n\nDeveloping an integrated air traffic control training platform that unifies AI-driven remote pilot operations, dynamic flight generation, and ATC emulation software into a streamlined interface for realistic training and scenario management.\n\nDeveloped and refactored a full-stack web application using React, Node.js, and TypeScript to interface with mission-critical ATC emulation systems, reducing front-end bundle size by 30% and improving application load times.\n\nImplemented real-time messaging infrastructure with ActiveMQ to enable reliable data exchange between on-premises emulation systems and containerized cloud-based microservices.\n",
